---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{#
  layouts/playground.njk
  ----------------------
  The playground Contact page. Letters and your contact details fall into
  the window as objects you can grab, throw and pile up. Click the email,
  phone or Instagram pill to use it; click an empty spot to add a shape.

  Where things come from:
    - Email, phone, Instagram and the intro text: the real Contact page
      (src/contact.md), edited from /admin -> Pages -> Contact.
    - The physics: assets/js/playground.bundle.js (source in tools/playground).

  Settings (on the [data-playground] element):
        data-words   the words that drop in as letter tiles, separated by spaces

  The plain links list below is what screen readers, keyboard users and
  visitors without JavaScript get, so the page always works without the toy.
#}
{% set c = contactPage.data %}
{% set handle = c.instagram | replace('https://www.instagram.com/', '') | replace('/', '') %}

<h1 class="visually-hidden">{{ title }}</h1>

<div class="cp" data-playground
     data-email="{{ c.email }}"
     data-phone="{{ c.phone }}"
     data-instagram="{{ c.instagram }}"
     data-handle="{% if handle %}@{{ handle }}{% endif %}"
     data-words="HELLO HOLA OLÁ CIAO HALLO BONJOUR">
  <canvas class="cp__canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

  <div class="cp__intro">{{ contactPage.html | safe }}</div>

  <p class="cp__hint" data-hint>Drag things around. Click an empty spot for more.</p>
  <p class="cp__toast" data-toast role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

  <ul class="cp__links">
    {% if c.email %}<li><a href="mailto:{{ c.email }}">{{ c.email }}</a></li>{% endif %}
    {% if c.phone %}<li><a href="tel:{{ c.phone | replace(' ', '') }}">{{ c.phone }}</a></li>{% endif %}
    {% if c.instagram %}<li><a href="{{ c.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram{% if handle %} @{{ handle }}{% endif %}</a></li>{% endif %}
  </ul>
</div>
